m, and rhythm shooting.\n\nEnter the zone and relive your life flashing before your eyes \u2014 on a roller coaster!\n\nTo the beat, capture the sock-fruits ripening on cacti with a dual-wielding, healing cyber-mokugyo (wooden fish)!\n\nPeek at fragments of memory hidden inside each sock-fruit \u2014 and revisit the ones you've found in the encyclopedia!\n\nVR trip packed with vaporwave, surrealism, Japanese local culture, and a homage to American Surrealism\u2026", "short_description": "A surreal Buddhist rhythm rail-shooter. To the beat, blast the sock-fruits ripening on cacti with dual-wielding healing cyber-mokugyo, while a roller coaster carries you through your life flashing before your eyes. Vaporwave, surrealism, Japanese local culture, and a homage to American Surrealism \u2014 a strangely addictive VR trip."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://chihuahua-games.chihuahuagames.workers.dev/apps/meta-quest/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ChihuahuaGames", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://chihuahua-games.chihuahuagames.workers.dev/apps/meta-quest/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1149358244930747"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1650276099377413"}]}, "b